comment on table public.inventory_price_floors is
  'Per-rarity minimum sell price. When staff price a card from its Scryfall/market reference price (Add Card, or matching a printing during scan review), the suggested price is floored to this value if the rarity has one set above 0. Never overrides a price staff type in by hand. Raising a floor (via PUT /api/admin/inventory/price-floors) also raises any existing non-archived inventory_items row of that rarity priced below the new floor -- it only ever raises a price, never lowers one, and lowering a floor never lowers anyone''s price back down.';
